            },
            "chunk_type": "esg_commitment",
            "content": "In response to the evolving cybersecurity threat landscape, we launched the Secure Future Initiative (\"SFI\") in November 2023 and expanded the scope of SFI in May 2024. The SFI focuses our business strategy and efforts on continual improvement in cybersecurity protection.",
